=== meta ===
bypass: 112
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: `when: manual` written into the template the test job `extends:`
origin: issue #214 — a job's `extends:` templates are merged in first, as GitLab merges them.
=== before: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - test

.tests:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest

test-py312:
  extends: .tests
=== after: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - test

.tests:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
  when: manual

test-py312:
  extends: .tests
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["CI_TEST_COMMAND_WEAKENED"]}]
